@startuml Sequence Diagram - Preview Widget

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "WidgetPreviewView" as PreviewView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "Backend" as Backend

Admin -> PreviewView : 1 Open widget preview page
activate PreviewView
PreviewView -> PreviewView : 2 Display widget preview

PreviewView -> ClerkAuth : 3 Request widget data
activate ClerkAuth
ClerkAuth -> Backend : 4 Fetch widget configuration
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend : 5 Retrieve widget data
Backend -> ClerkAuth : 6 Return widget data
ClerkAuth -> PreviewView : 7 Return widget info
PreviewView -> Admin : 8 Display widget preview

deactivate Backend
deactivate ClerkAuth
deactivate PreviewView

@enduml
